</span></td>
<td id="A4.T6.2.2.5" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_t" style="padding:1.25pt 3.0pt;">
<span id="A4.T6.2.2.5.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:79.5pt;">
